@startuml
title Preview szybkiej wymiany
autonumber

actor User
boundary WalletsController
control WalletService
control InstantExchangeService
control TransactionFeeCalculator
database Db

User -> WalletsController : POST /wallet/exchange/preview
WalletsController -> WalletService : PreviewTradeAsync
WalletService -> InstantExchangeService : PreviewAsync
InstantExchangeService -> TransactionFeeCalculator : oblicz fee
InstantExchangeService -> Db : kursy <= 7 dni
InstantExchangeService -> Db : płynność kont źródeł
InstantExchangeService -> InstantExchangeService : wybierz najlepszą ofertę
InstantExchangeService --> WalletsController : ExchangePreviewResultDto
WalletsController --> User : wynik symulacji

note right of InstantExchangeService
Brak SaveChanges.
Brak Transaction i ExchangeExecution.
end note
@enduml
